    {
      "id": "FAM:SF26",
      "status_as_recorded": "rejected",
      "finding": "A play-type forecasting model using Structural Influence after a hub sits showed no improvement over conventional features (LL gap +0.00002, Holm p=0.87). The null was adequately powered, indicating that lineup-driven play-type prediction may be very subtle even with sophisticated features."
